### PRIORITY 15: Environmental Sustainability in Primary Care — Low Carbon Respiratory Prescribing

**Definition:** Systematic transition from high-GWP pressurised metered dose inhalers (pMDIs) to dry powder inhalers (DPIs) or next-generation low-carbon devices in appropriate patients, combined with inhaler recycling schemes and sustainable prescribing education.

